  "additional": {
    "aboutAssay": "",
    "forReview": "The standard curve was acceptable, but we are not satisfied with the kit's performance because the OD values were much lower than expected. Since the manufacturer recommends a 1:500 sample dilution, we tested several dilutions around this range to see how the kit performed. The spike recovery was reasonably good (~82.13%), but unfortunately, the dilution linearity was very poor. Based on these results, we are not confident that this kit can reliably measure leptin in equine serum."
  },
